      "content": "\"Compound AX-77 demonstrated a significant reduction in inflammation among the target group, with most patients reporting improved well-being within the first week. Side effects were minimal, predominantly mild nausea or headaches. The efficacy of AX-77 was notably higher compared to the placebo group, underscoring its potential as a promising therapeutic agent.\"",
      "source": "target",
